@startuml credit-application
' The business process, as a process engineer draws it: who does what, in
' which order, and which way each decision goes.
title Credit application
footer owner: Retail Credit · CRD-101 CRD-102 CRD-103 CRD-104 CRD-105

|Customer|
start
:Submit credit application;
|Credit officer|
:Check completeness;
if (Application complete?) then (yes)
  |Risk engine|
  :Score applicant;
  if (Score sufficient?) then (yes)
    |Credit officer|
    :Approve credit;
  else (no)
    |Credit officer|
    :Reject application;
  endif
else (no)
  |Credit officer|
  :Request missing documents;
endif
|Credit officer|
:Inform customer;
stop
@enduml
